      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Feels like the next logical step now that VRChat has a built-in shop: have a few different tiers of VRC+ for those who want all the extra slots and then maybe some bundles in the shop of just extra Sticker / Emoji / Print slots etc. for those who either can't afford the higher subscription or who only want say 10 extra sticker slots but not the other benefits.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-07-06T18:35:01.930Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "NUMEROUS people I have talked to would gladly add more money onto their subscription as DLC to VRC+ to get more sticker, print and emoji slots in order to bring more of their art onto the platform. This would both be a good monetization path allowing for the price to prop up the extra space, while giving people the opportunity to not get the extra cost if they arent going to use the extra slots",
